    "abstract": "Parts figure for the forward cargo door surround, covering the fitting kit, the inboard frame sub-assembly, the aft spar cap and the fastener sets, with the pre and post protection standard split on the washer set.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the structural items of the forward cargo door surround and the fastener sets used to join them, on both sides of the aircraft.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the left-hand installation looking outboard; the right-hand installation is a mirror image and is not drawn. Sheet 2 shows the fastener detail at the frame foot. Item 40 and item 40A are alternates and must not be mixed on one door surround. Quantities on sheet 2 are for one door surround, both sides."
    },
